<section id="faq" class="py-20 bg-zinc-950 border-t border-b border-amber-500/10">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <span class="text-amber-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">Got Questions?</span>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
        Frequently Asked <span class="gold-gradient-text">Questions</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">
        Everything you need to know about BlackRoots Herbal Hair Dye Shampoo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <details class="group bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden p-6 text-left transition-all hover:border-amber-500/40">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-serif text-lg font-bold text-white cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span>Is BlackRoots Herbal Hair Dye Shampoo safe to use regularly?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon text-amber-400 transition-transform duration-300 font-bold">↓</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Yes! BlackRoots is formulated with 100% botanical active ingredients (Japanese Indigo, Amla, Shikakai, Bhringraj, Camellia Oil) and contains zero harsh chemicals like Ammonia or Hydrogen Peroxide. It is dermatologically tested for regular shower use.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <details class="group bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden p-6 text-left transition-all hover:border-amber-500/40">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-serif text-lg font-bold text-white cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span>How long before I see visible dark hair results?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon text-amber-400 transition-transform duration-300 font-bold">↓</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Because it works through natural botanical pigments rather than synthetic chemical bleaching, results build gradually. Scalp freshness and dandruff reduction start within the first week, while dark grey-coverage tones become noticeably richer over 3 to 4 weeks of consistent use (2-3 times weekly).
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <details class="group bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden p-6 text-left transition-all hover:border-amber-500/40">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-serif text-lg font-bold text-white cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span>Is BlackRoots suitable for both men and women?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon text-amber-400 transition-transform duration-300 font-bold">↓</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Absolutely. BlackRoots is unisex and formulated for all hair textures and hair types (straight, wavy, curly, coily) for both men and women looking to darken grey strands and reduce hair fall.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <details class="group bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden p-6 text-left transition-all hover:border-amber-500/40">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-serif text-lg font-bold text-white cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span>How should I perform a patch test before first use?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon text-amber-400 transition-transform duration-300 font-bold">↓</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Apply a small dime-sized quantity of BlackRoots shampoo behind your ear lobe or on your inner elbow. Leave it for 5-3 minutes and rinse off. Wait 24 hours. If no skin redness, itching or swelling occurs, you may safely use it on your scalp.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 5 -->
      <details class="group bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden p-6 text-left transition-all hover:border-amber-500/40">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-serif text-lg font-bold text-white cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span>What are the shipping charges and Cash on Delivery (COD) options?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon text-amber-400 transition-transform duration-300 font-bold">↓</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          We offer 100% FREE Delivery across all pin codes in India. Cash on Delivery (COD) is available nationwide at no extra charge. Orders are processed within 24 hours and delivered in 3 to 5 business days.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 6 -->
      <details class="group bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden p-6 text-left transition-all hover:border-amber-500/40">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-serif text-lg font-bold text-white cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span>What is the return and replacement policy?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon text-amber-400 transition-transform duration-300 font-bold">↓</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          We offer a 7-day hassle-free replacement policy for damaged, leaked, or wrong products received. Simply contact our support team at blackroots.in@gmail.com or WhatsApp +91 9580835179 with your order ID and unboxing photo/video.
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ Accordion",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
